A field the new version removes, that nothing maps or drops: a forgotten
rename would otherwise be silent data loss.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	before:    string
	unchanged: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	after:     string
	unchanged: string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		after: "x"
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: 0.0 declares before and 1.0 does not, and nothing maps it: write <field>: v0_0.before to move it, or before: drop
 --> 1.0.thema:6:1
  |
6 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
